omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1ork75gkBKQQ7kNvwE8PrM6&_nc_oc=AdqMRaEGjizj7annYAOZgNiuX2vBjD4dfT9mJ_DGn5wxex6AMi7bUtMA7ucP-4NRhpU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ4MQxCCT8j5AelbGtCEUjUAfE8Z9mhbnVPVveaAzX4kw&oe=6AB3EEB4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7utXDkgO2MUQ7kNvwGJ-KHN&_nc_oc=Adrlp2-iiUA3CHE3ylmICvTjGVNOn0SOPYWxKFKKqAhJsJ1_WolLScMg8dHYR34Tf4g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIRprBQzu7OASbBndNmALdyhR5qskVoKmoSXEI7mLSMoA&oe=6AB3F016"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2mIbH7d2MpEQ7kNvwEQcure&_nc_oc=AdrSwWyVVYrPZcmQV8auPEQq3VS4T03MiRuFQfc7aRbW8RpfWRijIBYSrGfJH_g4hGY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKb2U7EZGcfrZYzoBg0wuLg8sxMmSlc0kXTkUKu_acR_w&oe=6AB3CCF7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://